       "stem": "A 70 kg, 30 year-old man presents with burns following a house fire. The burns are confined to his torso and upper limbs, but exclude his head and neck. His burns are estimated at 40% of his body surface area.",
       "q": "State the Parkland formula used for burns fluid resuscitation. (10%) · What volume of which fluid will he require in the first 8 hours after injury? (10%) · What additional fluids in excess of the volume predicted in (B) might he require and why (25%)? · What monitoring and investigations are required in the first 24 hours (45%)?"
